# The delivery certificate and its key live here and are NEVER committed — M27.6.
#
# The key is pushed to every delivery host and answers for every name the certificate
# covers, so it belongs with `.env` on the list of things this repository must not carry.
# The directory itself IS committed, empty but for this file, because the control plane
# bind-mounts it read-only (deploy/docker-compose.yml) and a mount of a path the daemon
# has to create arrives owned by root.
*
!.gitignore
